ck an existing property and delete some images\n\nLet me check if there's a property-images API that can delete images.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The test will navigate to a specific property. I need to know which properties have what images. Let me look at what's available:\n\n- b4444444 has 2 images (apt1, apt2) - closest to single image\n- None have 0 images\n\nActually wait - looking at the seed data, I don't see a property with exactly 1 image or 0 images. So maybe I should:\n- For single image test: use property b4444444 (2 images) and delete one image via API if possible, OR just acknowledge this and find a way.\n\nActually, the test spec says to test these scenarios. Let me check if the property-images endpoint supports CRUD operations so I can manipulate the images for testing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2829,"cache_read_input_tokens":50673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2829,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03e91827-e3d9-45fe-a1ef-70f0600db152","uuid":"f2c56257-4ba6-49e3-9b4a-c2bd243543e7"}
